{%- comment -%}
  The site's MarkdownContent override around Starlight's MarkdownContent.astro: the image zoom dialog, the
  breadcrumbs, the What's New release badge, then the page's HTML (`mc_html` when a layout
  wraps it, as hub.liquid does, else `content`, the layout's input) in
  .sl-markdown-content. Root classes: cid-sl-markdown-content (the content wrapper).
{%- endcomment -%}
{% include "partials/image-zoom" %}
{% include "partials/breadcrumbs" %}
{% include "partials/release-meta" %}
<div class="sl-markdown-content cid-sl-markdown-content">{% if mc_html %}{{ mc_html }}{% else %}{{ content }}{% endif %}</div>
